  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let $k\\geq 2$ and $n$ be sufficiently large depending on $k$. Let $A=\\{a_1<a_2<\\cdots \\}$ be the set of those integers in $[n,n^k]$ which have a divisor in $(n,2n)$. Estimate $ \\max_{i} a_{i+1}-a_i. $ Is this $\\leq (\\log n)^{O(1)}$?\n\",\n    \"difficulty\": \"L1\"\n},{",
